          "title": "You'll want to know: вывод",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "вывод (vývod) — \"a conclusion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Какой вывод можно сделать? Kakóy vývod mózhno sdélat? What conclusion can we draw?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Сделать вывод (vývod) — to draw a conclusion. It also means withdrawal: вывод (vývod) войск."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "вывод (vývod) is built from вы- \"out\" and вод-, the root of водить \"to lead\", from Proto-Slavic voditi \"to lead, to conduct\" (EtymDB). A conclusion is what you lead out of the facts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
